    "mission": "Vision\n\nWe believe in the promise, genius, and ability of Chicago\u2019s Black and Brown youth & young adults, and we exist to help them lead us to better days.  \n\nMission\n\nAs a ministry of New Mount Pilgrim Missionary Baptist Church, we exist to educate and empower our youth and young adults, providing a safe and healing environment and engaging them in a Sankofa movement to restore our entire community.",
