    "program_description": "The MAAFA Center for Arts & Activism (The \u201cMAC\u201d), will continue to be the heart and headquarters of the MAAFA Redemption Project, a faith-based residential institute for Black and Brown young men and women. The MAC has created a safe and secure space in West Garfield Park, allowing for individual and communal healing and empowerment. After the renovation, the building will also meet the identified need for community-based arts, education, organizing and neighborhood activation. Its inter-generational arts-programming will nurture and amplify the artistic genius of neighborhood residents, cultivating a sense of communal pride, efficacy and renewal.",
